WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.320
I must do more store chores.

2
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.280
But chores are such a bore.

3
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.880
I cannot stare out the window.

4
00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:23.894
I must collect bus fares.

5
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:28.780
I cannot fall asleep and snore.

6
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:33.080
I must sweep the floor.

7
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.060
I must fix this tire.

8
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.780
And I must cut this wire.

9
00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.940
Before I leave, I must put out this fire.

10
00:00:48.991 --> 00:00:53.221
Whew! I'm tired.

11
00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.210
"Stop snoring!

12
00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.750
How dare you take a nap!

13
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:08.960
If you are so tired, then you will be fired."

14
00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:17.060
"Please do not fire me. Look, I'm doing more chores."

15
00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:46.510
5
